  "visible_text_sample": "SERVICES\nCASE STUDIES\nABOUT\nNEWS\nFootball Predictions & Analysis\n\n⚽️\n\nWelcome to Football4Cast! Get data-driven predictions and season insights from 70+ leagues around the world – including our powerful, graded betting analysis 🏆\n\nLeagues\n\nSee our Global League Coverage – over 30 countries and 70 leagues! 🌍\n\nAbout Football4Cast\n\nJust what is going on here?\n\nAbout Football4Cast\n\nFootball4Cast grew out of the analytics work we do for clubs. We already had the data and the models, so we started publishing a slice of it for fans – the same idea that began with Rugby4Cast.\n\nUnder the hood, every match is rated by our Elo-based model, which tracks the relative strength of more than 2,000 teams across 70+ leagues in 30-plus countries – from the Premier League and La Liga down to the Primera RFEF and the Allsvenskan, plus internationals and the World Cup. The ratings shift with every result, turn into a probability for each home win, draw and away win, and drive our graded value-betting analysis.\n\nHave a dig around and you’ll find predictions and rankings for whichever league you follow – and the reasoning behind them. The aim’s simple: help you understand the teams, their chances, and where the value lies.\n\nThe Data, Predictions and Tipping\n\nSo how do these work?\n\nSee more\nAll football leagues we cover\n\nSports4Cast runs machine-learning match predictions, live Elo power rankings and results analysis across 70+ football leagues and competitions worldwide, updated daily. Explore our coverage by country and competition:\n\nEnglish Football predictions\nPremier League, Championship, League One & League Two\nSpanish Football predictions\nLa Liga, La Liga 2, Primera RFEF Grp 1 & Primera RFEF Grp 2\nGerman Football predictions\nBundesliga, 2. Bundesliga & 3. Liga\nItalian Football predictions\nSerie A, Serie B, Serie C Grp A, Serie C Grp B & Serie C Grp C\nFrench Football predictions\nLigue 1, Ligue 2 & National 1\nEuropean Football predictions\nUEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League & UEFA Conference League\nScottish Football predictions\nPremiership, Championship, League One & League Two\nGreek Football predictions\nSuperleague & Super League 2\nDanish Football predictions\nSuperliga & 1st Division\nPortuguese Football predictions\nPrimeira Liga & LigaPro\nDutch Football predictions\nEredivisie & Eerste Divisie\nBelgian Football predictions\nPro League & 1st Division B\nTurkish Football predictions\nSüper Lig & 1. Lig\nNorwegian Football predictions\nEliteserien & 1. Divisjon\nCzech Football pr",
